# Delete Workspace Sheet

::summary
The delete-workspace confirmation sheet, opened from the Workspace settings danger zone: consequence statement first, then typed-name confirmation gating the danger button. Distinct from `modals/delete-account.surf` (account-level, password + phrase).
::

::modal[name=delete-workspace title="Delete workspace" width=340 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::row[icon=file href=#]
This deletes cloudsurf for everyone
30-day grace, then docs, tasks, apps, files, and messages are gone
:::

:::form[name=delete-workspace submit="Delete workspace" action=confirmDeleteWorkspace]
- Workspace name (text, "Type the workspace name to confirm") *
:::

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. The danger button stays disabled until the typed name matches exactly; deletion enters the 30-day grace during which an owner can restore from the workspace switcher.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
